          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_introduces_skinn_stellar_kinematics",
          "text": "This paper introduces SKiNN, the Stellar Kinematics Neural Network, a proof-of-concept emulator that reproduces slow physics-based kinematics calculations at a fraction of the cost.",
