          "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_after_one_time_phase_skinn_generates",
          "text": "After a one-time training phase, SKiNN generates velocity dispersion images that are accurate to within about one percent in the scientifically important region, while running two to three orders of magnitude faster than existing methods.",
