          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c4_speedup_finally_makes_feasible_spati",
          "text": "This speedup finally makes it feasible to model spatially resolved kinematic data jointly with lensing data, addressing the largest source of uncertainty in Hubble constant measurements.",
