          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s02_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c2_but_lensing_degeneracies_allow_many",
          "text": "But lensing degeneracies allow many different mass distributions to reproduce the same image, so independent kinematic constraints are needed to break them. The trouble is speed.",
