          "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_modeling_galaxy_kinematics_physics_c",
          "text": "Modeling galaxy kinematics with a physics code like JAM is slow, and it must be recomputed for every single likelihood evaluation inside a Markov Chain Monte Carlo sampling.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
