          "chunk_id": "s02_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c4_makes_jointly_exploring_full_lensing",
          "text": "This makes jointly exploring the full lensing and kinematics parameter space computationally prohibitive, forcing modelers to cut corners by fitting the two components separately.",
