          "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_traditional_spherical_jeans_models_t",
          "text": "Traditional spherical Jeans models are too simplistic for this richer data, and they lack self-consistency with the elliptical mass models used in lensing.",
