          "chunk_id": "s03_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_natural_next_step_axisymmetric_model",
          "text": "The natural next step is axisymmetric modeling with software such as JAM, but JAM is expensive. Existing frameworks that combine it with lens modeling either fit the two separately or remain far too slow for full joint parameter exploration.",
