          "chunk_id": "s05_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c1_skinn_precalculates_jam_lensing_appl",
          "text": "SKiNN precalculates JAM for use in lensing applications. Formally, it is a function that maps an eight-dimensional vector of galaxy parameters into a d by d image of vrms, the quadratic sum of velocity dispersion and rotational velocity.",
