          "chunk_id": "s05_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c2_eight_inputs_describe_power_law_elli",
          "text": "The eight inputs describe a power-law elliptical mass distribution and an elliptical Sérsic light profile, plus the galaxy inclination and orbital anisotropy.",
