          "chunk_id": "s05_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c3_architecture_consists_five_blocks_tw",
          "text": "The architecture consists of five blocks, each with two two-dimensional convolutional layers followed by an upsampling layer and a ReLU nonlinearity, for about seven million trainable parameters.",
